  "description": "SKY130 NFET flavors: bandwidth / f_T (fixture-free |h21|)",
  "schematic": {
    "notes": [
      {
        "x": 110,
        "y": -118,
        "title": "SKY130 NFET f_T — what this testbench does",
        "lines": [
          "Four NFET flavors (MN1 nfet, MN2 lvt, MN3 nvt, MN4 5v)",
          "each sit at a fixed bias: gate VG, drain VD, source",
          "grounded. The AC sweep (10 MHz -> 1 THz) extracts the",
          "small-signal current gain h21; f_T is where |h21| = 1.",
          "Probes in_* / out_* mark each device's ports.",
          "Short channels (MN1, l = 0.15 um) reach the highest f_T.",
          "",
          "Set MN1.l_um = 0.5 and re-run to see that device's f_T",
          "drop -- f_T falls as channel length grows."
        ]
      }
    ],
